        "params": {
          "text": "ANDROID DREAMS\n\nRobotic singing voice driven by arpeggiator and Lorenz chaos engine.\n\nSignal: Wavetable (Vocal bank) + Noise → Crossfader → VCA → Choir → Pitch Shifter → Delay → Reverb → Output\n\n- Wavetable: Bank 1 (Vocal), 3-voice unison\n- Arpeggiator: Diverge mode, ratchet 2x with 40% decay, mutate 30%, accent Sync\n- Crossfader: Mixes voice/breath noise, driven by Chaos Y\n- Choir: Vowel driven by Chaos X for organic variation\n- Pitch Shifter: Subtle glitches via Chaos Z (attenuated through CV-VCA)\n- Delay: Ping-pong for stereo width\n\nPlay notes with HOLD enabled for best arpeggiator effect.\nAdjust Chaos speed for slower/faster evolution."
        }
